**Title:** Twilight Whispers: Finn and Ripple's Tranquil Shore Journey

**Description:** Immerse yourself in the calming tale of Finn, an 11-year-old boy with an open heart, who drifts along the serene coastline with Ripple, his playful otter companion. As the sun sets in hues of coral and gold, Finn discovers the secret stories whispered by the ocean's gentle waves. Amidst the rhythmic lull of the sea and the graceful dance of the evening tide, Finn learns to embrace inner calm and peace. This sleep story is crafted to guide you into a restful slumber, easing anxiety and fostering an emotional haven through its soothing narrative.

